  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 18
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 'Well done.

    ... Now, you can pass through this portal.

    Go
    through it and you''ll find yourself back where you belong.

    But remember,
    when you return to your world, you''ll find Robo there with you. He''s your gift.'
  description: 
